		(property "Description" "Shunt FL-2 100A/75mV (0,75 mOhm, manganin+brass; 104 mm total, blok terminal 22 mm, post 7,7 mm). Pin 1 = baut M5 blok BATTERY- (star point PGND, D6/OPEN-007); pin 2 = baut M5 blok SYSTEM- (return beban 100 A); pin 3 = terminal Kelvin M3 K+ (blok BAT-); pin 4 = terminal Kelvin M3 K- (blok SYS-). Posisi pad = VERIFIKASI UNIT FISIK (OPEN-001R). Pour 100 A dua sisi + via stitching + clearance termal >=10 mm saat layout S9."
