	(text "TABEL POLARITAS KELVIN (gate S3 — cross-check kontrak firmware):\nK+ (blok BAT-) -> INA219 IN+ (pin 1); K- (blok SYS-) -> INA219 IN- (pin 2).\nDISCHARGE (baterai -> beban): arus konvensional SYS- -> BAT- melalui elemen shunt\n-> V(IN+) - V(IN-) = V(BAT-) - V(SYS-) < 0 -> pembacaan INA219 NEGATIF.\nCHARGE (PV -> baterai): arus BAT- -> SYS- -> V(IN+) - V(IN-) > 0 -> POSITIF.\nFirmware WAJIB memetakan tanda ini (deviasi #2 audit — konfirmasi tim firmware).\nFSR shunt +/-80 mV -> clip +/-106,7 A (80 mV / 0,75 mOhm) — di atas rating 100 A."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 124 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e0fdd69b-8724-4079-8365-2f248c90f085")	)
	(text "STAR POINT (D6/OPEN-007): node BAT- = blok terminal shunt sisi baterai.\nNT0 (PGND<->BAT-, Pad2.0mm) ditempatkan DI STAR — satu-satunya titik temu return\nelektronik (~38 mA) dengan jalur force; arus elektronik TIDAK melewati elemen shunt\n-> INA219 membaca murni arus baterai. J_BAT.2 (sheet 01) ter-tie ke net BAT- ini.\nNT1 (AGND<->PGND, Pad0.5mm) di area INA219 (DN-S0-03); NT2 (DGND<->PGND, area\nESP32) ditunda ke S9. Finalisasi net-tie vs single-GND = keputusan S9 (DN-S0-03)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 140 124 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5ec61d2e-0755-4c9a-a2b0-59d01e14c3e8")	)
	(text "U3 INA219AIDCNR (SOT-23-8, I2C 0x40 = A0:A1:GND:GND): IN+ pin 1 <- SHUNT_K+,\nIN- pin 2 <- SHUNT_K- (penomoran TERVERIFIKASI simbol resmi Sensor_Energy).\nFSR shunt programmable +/-40/80/160/320 mV — rencana +/-80 mV. Bus-voltage INA219\nTIDAK dipakai sbg pengukur V-bat (rule #3 task spec; V-bat = divider sheet 04).\nCommon-mode IN maks +/-75 mV vs AGND — jauh dalam batas -0,3...26 V datasheet.\nC20 100nF pin-adjacent VS. Jalur Kelvin = pasangan diferensial rapat & pendek\n(kelas KELVIN 0,25 mm; jauh dari pour high-current & modul M1 — S9)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 148 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "90365322-9bd9-4c12-a3f5-09450d8ceb33")	)
	(text "OPEN-001R: posisi terminal Kelvin & lubang baut FL-2 = VERIFIKASI UNIT FISIK\nsebelum fab. Footprint parametrik: outline 104x22 mm; baut M5 x=+/-41 (pad 12 mm,\ndrill 5,5); Kelvin M3 x=+/-33 y=+7,5 (pad 6,5, drill 3,4) — estimasi foto produk.\nTP_SHUNT_K+ / TP_SHUNT_K- (S7) mengetuk net Kelvin di sheet 11.\nLayout S9: pour 100 A dua sisi + via stitching + clearance termal >=10 mm\nsekeliling RSH1; tanpa komponen di bawah shunt."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 140 148 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1849d9f3-ea99-46b8-97c2-ae1e00a38436")	)
	(text_box "03_CURRENT_SHUNT — pengukuran arus baterai presisi (S3).\nRSH1 FL-2 100A/75mV (0,75 mOhm): pin 1 baut M5 blok BATTERY- = star point PGND (D6);\n  pin 2 baut M5 blok SYSTEM- (return beban 100 A); pin 3 K+ (Kelvin blok BAT-);\n  pin 4 K- (Kelvin blok SYS-). Jalur force 100 A = copper zone dua sisi + pad baut\n  + via stitching (S9) — BUKAN trace. Posisi pad = OPEN-001R (verifikasi unit fisik).\nU3 INA219AIDCNR (SOT-23-8, I2C 0x40): IN+ (pin 1) <- SHUNT_K+; IN- (pin 2) <- SHUNT_K-;\n  GND -> AGND; A0=A1=AGND (0x40); VS -> +3V3 + C20 100nF pin-adjacent; SDA/SCL -> bus.\nNT0 = net-tie PGND<->BAT- DI STAR (DN-S3-01); NT1 = net-tie AGND<->PGND area analog\n  (DN-S0-03); NT2 (DGND<->PGND) area ESP32 — ditunda S9.\nGATE: INA219 tidak menyentuh 54 V (netlist proof di validasi skrip)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
		(size 180 48)
		(stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type none))
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "9b717496-6260-4593-831c-d3aa95c5a540")
	)
